 ('how-to-make-faceless-youtube-shorts','How to make faceless YouTube Shorts','Plan repeatable Shorts without appearing on camera.','Choose a series promise|Pick a topic and recognizable format: one question, historical moment, comparison, or puzzle.','Give every Short one job|Answer one question, tell one compact story, or reveal one useful comparison.','Write a visual brief|Name audience, opening, scenes, tone, narration, and ending. Say what should be visible.','Review for discovery|Watch without prior context and check the first seconds, phone readability, and payoff.','Publish responsibly|Verify claims, rights, captions, and current YouTube requirements.'),
 ('faceless-tiktok-video-ideas','Faceless TikTok video ideas','Five repeatable formats that do not require filming yourself.','Visual fact|Show an unexpected comparison and give context so the viewer understands why it matters.','Tiny story|Give a character one goal, one obstacle, and one visible change.','Mystery clue|Introduce an unusual detail, reveal useful clues, and make the ending follow from them.','Guess-and-reveal|Ask a fair question, pause, then give the answer and reason.','Series test|Choose a format you could make ten times without repeating the same subject; consistency is not a reach guarantee.'),
 ('how-to-make-animated-tiktok-videos','How to make animated TikTok videos','Plan a vertical TikTok around one idea and one payoff.','Put the point first|Write what the viewer will learn, feel, or discover and use it to choose the opening frame.','Make the action visible|Use a moving object, before-and-after state, comparison, or character choice.','Write for the phone|Use short lines, high contrast, and safe space.','Create a satisfying close|Answer the question, complete the joke, reveal the clue, or show the consequence.','Check before posting|Watch the export, verify claims, review captions and rights.'),
